'''Estus''' is a [[Human|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found at the forging station in [[Farnum's Farm]] located in the [[Southern Wilds]]. He sells exclusively [[Blacksmith]] [[Jobs|Job]] [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*[[Blacksmith's Flair Shard of the Forest]]
*[[Blacksmith's Flair Shard of Ice]]
*[[Blacksmith's Power Shard of Talen I]]
*[[Blacksmith's Necklace of Timing I]]
*[[Blacksmith's Ring of Talen I]]
*[[Blacksmith's Hammer of Talent I]]
*[[Dancing Monkey Bokken Recipe]]

==Trivia==
*Estus was introduced in-game on August 6, 2013.
